## Fixture: a firstmate home clone (origin kunchenguid/firstmate) and a project clone (origin cli/cli)
$ bin/fm-gh-repo.sh $T/project
cli/cli
exit=0

## Reproduce the incident: shell inside the firstmate home, no --repo, no GH_REPO
$ env -u GH_REPO gh issue view 34 --json url -q .url
https://github.com/kunchenguid/firstmate/pull/34
exit=0

## With the GH_REPO fm-spawn would export
GH_REPO=cli/cli
$ gh issue view 34 --json url -q .url
https://github.com/cli/cli/pull/34
exit=0
$ gh-axi issue view 34 | head -5
gh: Could not resolve to an Issue with the number of 34.
issue:
  number: 34
  repo: cli/cli
  title: Eliminate package-level global state

## Explicit --repo still overrides GH_REPO
$ gh issue view 34 --repo kunchenguid/firstmate --json url -q .url
https://github.com/kunchenguid/firstmate/pull/34
exit=0
